@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@user = 0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000007

### Green room: capacity 4, open 08:00-18:00 UTC
# @name rooms
GET {{base}}/rooms?name=green

### Valid booking -> 201 (dates must be in the future)
# @name booking
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2026-10-05T09:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z"}

### Overlap -> 409
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2026-10-05T09:30:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T10:30:00Z"}

### Adjacent slot is fine -> 201
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T11:00:00Z"}

### Capacity exceeded -> 422 rule booking.capacity_exceeded
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2026-10-05T12:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T13:00:00Z", "attendees": 9}

### Outside opening hours -> 422
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2026-10-05T17:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T19:00:00Z"}

### In the past -> 422
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2025-01-01T09:00:00Z", "endTime": "2025-01-01T10:00:00Z"}

### Delete room with upcoming bookings -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/rooms/{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}

### Cancel -> 200, second time -> 409
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}/cancel
